<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-PROVISIONAL RESULTS OF WORLD CUP WOMEN'S SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-PROVISIONAL RESULTS OF WORLD CUP WOMEN'S SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>PARK CITY, Utah 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional leading</p>
<p>results of World Cup women's slalom on Saturday (tabulate</p>
<p>under combined time, first run, second run):</p>
<p>1. Claudia Riegler (New Zealand) 1:36.50 (49.90-46.18)</p>
<p>2. Pernila Wiberg (Sweden) 1:36.57 (50.39-46.18)</p>
<p>3. Ingrid Salvenmoser (Austria) 1:37.49 (51.42-46.07)</p>
<p>4. Patricia Chauvet (France) 1:37.73 (51.58-46.15)</p>
<p>5. Sabine Egger (Austria) 1:37.74 (51.42-46.32)</p>
<p>6. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) 1:37.75 (51.08-46.67)</p>
<p>7 equal Urska Hrovat (Slovenia) 1:38.50 (51.73-46.77)</p>
<p>7 equal Elfi Eder (Austria) 1:38.50 (50.88-47.62)</p>
<p>9. Anita Wachter (Austria) 1:38.70 (51.87-46.83)</p>
<p>10. Leila Piccard (France) 1:39.04 (52.547-46.57)</p>
